        "line": 6,
        "column": 1
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "location": {
            "line": 6,
            "column": 1
          },
          "text": "Use it to log standard Facebook events, custom events, purchases, and value-bearing events with currency metadata. It also exposes advertiser tracking controls for Android and legacy iOS, while reporting App Tracking Transparency authorization on iOS 17 and above."
